                            <h1 class="blog-heading-css">Advantages of Social Media Marketing</h1>
                            <a href="#"><img src="images/Advantages of Social Media Marketing.webp" class="img-responsive" alt="Advantages of Social Media Marketing" /></a><br>
                            <div class="cus-bullet">
                                <h3>TABLE OF CONTENT</h3>
                                <li><a href="#1">Introduction</a></li>
